<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African March tractor sales six percent up yr/yr.</title>
<headline>S.African March tractor sales six percent up yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African tractor sales were six percent up on a year ago in March at 452 units while first quarter sales were 14 percent ahead, the Agricultural Machinery Association said on Monday.</p>
<p>Sales of combine harvesters were disappointing at nine units in March against 30 a year ago, but reflected uncertainty as to what the summer crop prospects were likely to be, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
